{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39923","headline":"忆旧山 · 徐夤","name":"忆旧山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涧竹岩云有旧期，二年频长鬓边丝。\n游鱼不爱金桮水，栖鸟敢求琼树枝。\n陶景恋深松桧影，留侯抛却帝王师。\n龙争虎攫皆闲事，数叠山光在梦思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}